.TH SWIFT-TOUCH-KDE 1 "April 2026" "swift-touch-kde 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
swift-touch-kde \- Acer Swift multimedia touchpad CLI for Linux/KDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swift-touch-kde
.I command
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBswift-touch-kde\fR provides low-level HID tooling and a runtime daemon that
maps Acer Swift multimedia touchpad actions to media keys.
.PP
Run \fBswift-touch-kde --help\fR for the full command list.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B swift-touch-kde scan
Scan supported HID devices.
.TP
.B swift-touch-kde run-media-keys --dev /dev/hidraw0 --seconds 0 --emit uinput --require-active
Run media-key daemon mode.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/systemd/user/swift-touch-media.service
User service unit installed by the package.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/udev/rules.d/85-swift-touch-kde.rules
udev permissions for hidraw/uinput access.
